    "detailed_description": "In <strong>Pushover</strong>, your goal is to <i>push</i> your friends off the platforms! In this local or online multiplayer couch game you can fight with and against up to 4 people (or computers) on a variety of different stages! Or you can choose to play in the singleplayer Champion Village to complete challenges and unlock new characters and worlds! With 2 gamemodes there is an endless amount of <i>pushing</i> fun!<br><br><strong>Includes:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple stages<br></li><li> chaotic items<br></li><li> Online or local multiplayer with up to 4 players<br></li><li> a single player mode to unlock new worlds and characters<br></li><li> Timed and Livestock gamemode<br></li><li> fun movement and <i>pushing</i>!</li></ul>",
